{"sections": [
  {"key": "arc", "title": "The arc", "sentences": [
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Rivian went from no revenue in FY2020 to $5,387 million in FY2025, a 48.1% three-year CAGR from FY2022 [F2][F7][D342]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "The step change came in FY2022, when revenue jumped 2914.5% to $1,658 million on deliveries of 19,412 vehicles [F4][D83][P67]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Growth then decelerated sharply: 167.4% in FY2023, 12.1% in FY2024 and 8.4% in FY2025 [D135][D187][D239]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "The FY2025 slowdown came as deliveries fell 9,332 vehicles, partly on the expiration of 45W tax credits after September 30, 2025 [P22]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "drivers", "title": "What drove growth", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "In FY2025 Software and Services contributed 21.6pp of the 8.4% revenue growth, while Automotive subtracted 13.2pp [D323][D316][D239]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Software and services revenue rose 221.7% to $1,557 million, driven by vehicle electrical architecture and software development services for the Joint Venture, remarketing and repair [S26][D322][P18]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "New electric vehicles fell 12.5% to $3,639 million and were 67.6% of revenue, down from 83.7% in FY2024 [S11][D287][D286][D283]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Automotive revenue fell 14.6% to $3,830 million on lower deliveries and lower regulatory credit sales, partly offset by higher average selling prices [S23][D315][P22]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating costs grew 6.9% against 8.4% revenue growth, so incremental operating margin was 264.7% as the loss narrowed [D258][D239][D265]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "margins", "title": "Margins and costs", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Gross margin turned positive at 2.7% in FY2025, against a window median of -45.8% and a FY2021 low of -845.5% [F19][D332][D330]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating margin improved 27.8pp to -66.5%, still far below the peer median of -1.6% [D253][F31][D344]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Cost of revenue fell 15.0% and added 26.8pp to operating margin, as fewer vehicles were produced and raw material and conversion costs fell [D255][D267][P21]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "SG&A subtracted 0.5pp as go-to-market expansion raised payroll, stock-based compensation and facilities expenses [D269][P13]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin of -67.7% sat 1.1pp below operating margin, as a $186 million securities litigation settlement lifted other expense [F43][D359][P10]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating cash flow was -$779 million and free cash flow -$2,489 million in FY2025, a -46.2% free-cash-flow margin against a window median of -132.9% [F64][F78][D226][D335]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "The operating outflow narrowed from $1,716 million primarily on a significant reduction in net loss [F63][F64][P4]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex rose 49.9% to $1,710 million, 31.7% of revenue and 2.18x D&A, on Normal Factory capacity expansion [F71][D246][D225][D228][P3]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Stock-based compensation of $741 million equaled 20.7% of the operating loss, so cash burn understates the economic cost [X56][D237]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "balance_sheet", "title": "Balance sheet and capital allocation", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Net cash fell to $1,642 million from $3,259 million as cash and investments dropped 21.0% to $6,082 million against $4,440 million of debt [D231][D179][D261][D229][D230]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "The current ratio fell to 2.33x, a window low, from a 4.94x median, as current liabilities grew 64.1% [F129][D339][D341][D251]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Cash and investments cover 2.4 years of the latest burn, and operating margin sits at the 25th percentile of four autos peers [D236][D343]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Financing brought in $886 million, mainly $750 million of Class A shares issued to Volkswagen Group, while the diluted share count rose 17.1% [F92][P2][D260]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "red_flags", "title": "Red flags", "sentences": [
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Rivian has posted a net loss in each of the last seven years, from -$426 million in FY2019 to -$3,646 million in FY2025 [R1][F32][F38]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Stock-based compensation was 13.8% of revenue in FY2025 and at least 10% in each of the last five years [R2][D223][D31]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "New electric vehicles, 67.6% of revenue, fell 12.5% in FY2025, and Automotive, 71.1% of revenue, fell 14.6% [R4][R5][D286][D287][D314][D315]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Cash and investments cover only 2.4 years of the latest burn, down from 4.1 years in FY2021 [R3][D236][D44]."},
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Product revenue members sum to 129% of consolidated revenue in FY2025, so segment shares should not be added together [R6]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "watch", "title": "What to watch", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Whether gross margin holds above the FY2025 level of 2.7% or slips back toward the -24.1% of FY2024, reported in the FY2026 10-K [F19][F18]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Whether operating cash flow narrows past the FY2025 outflow of $779 million toward breakeven, or widens back toward the $1,716 million FY2024 outflow [F64][F63]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Whether the current ratio recovers above the 2.33x FY2025 low or falls further as current liabilities of $3,693 million come due [F129][F117]."}
  ]}
]}
